{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../terminate_session/", "title": "terminate_session()"}, "next": {"link": "../send_message/", "title": "send_message()"}, "title": "terminate_all_other_sessions()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"terminate-all-other-sessions\">\n<h1>terminate_all_other_sessions()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#terminate-all-other-sessions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.terminate_all_other_sessions\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">terminate_all_other_sessions</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.terminate_all_other_sessions\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Terminates all other sessions of the current user.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code> \u2013 On success, in case the session is destroyed, True is returned. Otherwise, False is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>RPCError</strong> \u2013 In case of a Telegram RPC error.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], [